{"id":"wb-5-219","name":"南安寺塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"南安寺塔","text":"南安寺塔是位于中国河北省蔚县城内南门西侧的辽代佛塔。南安寺塔为砖石结构八面十三级实心密檐式塔，地下有地宫。南安寺兴建早于蔚州建城，毁于明初，仅存寺塔。2001年被列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位，2010年，南安寺塔地宫遭盗挖，次年地宫文物被盗案破获。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8D%97%E5%AE%89%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%94","revisionId":94973990,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94973990","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/c0d6e87c45ab46e460f6daf6.jpg","title":"位于蔚县的南安寺塔.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E4%BD%8D%E4%BA%8E%E8%94%9A%E5%8E%BF%E7%9A%84%E5%8D%97%E5%AE%89%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%94.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/60/%E4%BD%8D%E4%BA%8E%E8%94%9A%E5%8E%BF%E7%9A%84%E5%8D%97%E5%AE%89%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%94.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"HaziiDozen","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​位于蔚县的南安寺塔","width":320,"height":730}}